# Seven Ways — environment files
#
# Layout (Next.js load order):
#   .env.development          → public defaults for `next dev`   (committed)
#   .env.production           → public defaults for prod build   (committed)
#   .env.local                → local secrets                    (gitignored)
#   .env.production.local     → prod secrets on server / CI      (gitignored)
#   .env.production.example   → empty secrets checklist for Hostinger / sevenways.uz
#
# Supabase project: udplvssgghqajxwbjkyv
# Dashboard: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/udplvssgghqajxwbjkyv
#
# Never commit secrets. Never use NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_*.

